Package: kitItemBank
Title: KIT Item Bank Query and Maintenance Tool
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-11-01
Authors@R: person("Jie-Wen", "Tsai", email = "tsai.jiewen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'shiny' app for the KIT item bank (Taiwan Early Childhood
    Development Survey Database): search items by keyword, wave and
    dimension, compare an item across waves and versions, browse dimensions
    with a network graph and dimension reports, and edit dimension and wave
    assignments. The app never writes files; edited item banks are downloaded
    as Excel files with a change log.
